; THE HUNTERS' RISE - the Ash Hunters' field station (location.ashen.station), on a low rise above the
; scar road where the Hunters can watch both Last Hearth and the Beast Lord's plateau. A watch tower,
; a tent line and a fire; Hask Morrow, the warden, keeps it. The road comes up from the south at
; (0, 20) and leaves east at (20, 0); nothing stands within six metres of it.
